|---------|---------|------------|-----------|--------------|---------------|
| **Player Inventory Viewer** | Audit/verify player inventories without stealing | Open GUI → list/search online players → click → read-only inventory grid | Server → Client packet on open. Refreshes every 2s or on player inventory change. | No item movement. Hover shows metadata, enchantments, durability. "Audit Mode" logs all viewed inventories. | GUI opens/closes cleanly. Data stays in sync. No memory leaks. Permission gate blocks non-admins. |
| **Ender Chest Viewer** | View player ender chests for admin oversight | Same flow as inventory viewer. Shows per-player ender chest grid. | Server stores ender chest state. Syncs on GUI open + periodic tick. | Strictly read-only. Admins cannot move ender items. "Export List" button generates plain-text item list (no NBT injection). | Accurate per-player isolation. Handles empty/locked chests. No cross-player data leakage. |

**Technical Constraints**:
- Both use vanilla `Container`/`Screen` architecture
- Data fetched via `PlayerInventory` & `EnderChestContainer` (server-side only)
- Network packets: `OpenInventoryGui`, `SyncInventoryData`, `CloseInventoryGui`
- Config toggle: `enable_inventory_viewer`, `enable_ender_chest_viewer`

---
## 🔹 PHASE 2: X-RAY DETECTOR & ORE AUDIT TOOL
*Reframed as a server-side debug/audit utility to stay within Minecraft modding guidelines & server policies.*

| Feature | Purpose | UI/UX Flow | Data Sync | Safety Rules | Done Criteria |
|---------|---------|------------|-----------|--------------|---------------|
| **Ore Visibility & X-Ray Audit** | Debug ore distribution, track admin line-of-sight, detect suspicious x-ray patterns | Toggle key → renders ore blocks in radius with color-coded overlays. GUI shows stats: ores exposed, player LOS, suspicious activity log. | Server calculates ore positions, sends overlay data to client. Client renders via `RenderPhase`/`Tesselator`. | No chunk modification. Only visual overlay. Tracks player mining speed, torch placement, rapid ore exposure. Logs heuristics. | Renders correctly in all dimensions. FPS impact &lt;3%. Logs accurate patterns. No false positives on legitimate play. |

**Heuristics Engine** (Server-Side):
- Tracks: `ores_exposed_per_minute`, `torch_density`, `mining_speed_deviation`, `chunk_update_frequency`
- Flags: Player exposes &gt;80% ores in radius without light sources, mines at &gt;2x normal speed, receives abnormal chunk updates
- Output: `/admin audit xray &lt;player&gt;` shows risk score + timeline
- Config: `xray_radius=32`, `enable_los_tracking=true`, `log_suspicious=true`

**Technical Constraints**:
- Client renders via overlay renderer (no block state changes)
- Server runs lightweight ore scanner on chunk load/player move
- Packets: `SyncOverlayData`, `SendAuditReport`, `ToggleOverlay`
- Performance capped: Max 2 scanner ticks/sec, GPU overlay limited to visible chunks

---
## 🔹 PHASE 3: SAFETY, LOGGING & CONFIG
| Component | Purpose | Implementation Notes |
|-----------|---------|----------------------|
| **Permission Gate** | Block non-admins | `hasAdminAccess(Player)` checks OP status or custom permission node. Fails gracefully with chat message. |
| **Action Logger** | Audit trail | JSON file: `[timestamp] [admin] [action] [target] [result]`. Configurable rotation & retention. |
| **Rate Limiter** | Prevent spam | 5 GUI opens/sec, 2 audit requests/sec. Cooldown triggers warning + logs. |
| **Config System** | Feature toggles | External config file. Hot-reloadable. Validates ranges & types. |
| **Error Handling** | Stability | Catches all exceptions. Logs to file. Shows user-friendly messages. No stack traces in chat. |

---
## 🏗️ ARCHITECTURE & DATA FLOW
```
[Admin Player] 
   ↓ (Keybind/Command)
[Permission Gate] → Blocks if !hasAdminAccess()
   ↓
[Feature Router] → Inventory Viewer | Ender Chest Viewer | X-Ray Audit
   ↓
[Server State Fetch] → Reads PlayerInventory / EnderChest / Chunk Ores
   ↓
[Network Packet] → Syncs to Client (read-only, validated)
   ↓
[Client GUI/Overlay] → Renders safely, no world modification
   ↓
[Logger] → Records action, target, result, timestamp
```
- **Thread Safety**: All server reads on main thread. GUI updates on client thread.
- **Memory**: GUIs dispose on close. Overlay renderer releases GPU resources. No cached player data beyond session.
- **Compatibility**: No mixin overrides. Uses standard modding APIs. Safe with most mods.

