- `Block_Broken` is strictly `true` or `false` → easy filtering in Excel/Sheets (`=FILTER(..., D:D="true")`)
- Placed after coordinates → keeps spatial data grouped, then action type, then inventory changes
- Empty item fields use `""` → CSV parsers won’t shift columns when one side is empty
- Always logs, even if no items moved (useful for tracking container griefing)

