## 🏗️ CORE ARCHITECTURE
| Component | Responsibility | Fabric API |
|-----------|----------------|------------|
| `PermissionManager` | Central gate: `hasFeatureAccess(player, feature)` | Checks `player.hasPermission("admin.tools.*")` + role config |
| `RoleConfig` | Parse/hot-reload `roles.json` | `FabricLoader` + `Gson` + `ServerLifecycleEvents.SERVER_STARTED` |
| `CsvWriter` | Async file writer for chest tracker | `Executors.newSingleThreadExecutor()` + `BufferedWriter` |
| `NetworkHandler` | Custom packets for GUI sync, alerts, reports | `ServerPlayNetworking` / `ClientPlayNetworking` |
| `Scheduler` | 10s delay for alerts | `ScheduledExecutorService` (Java) |
| `HeuristicEngine` | Behavioral tracking & scoring | `PlayerMoveCallback`, `PlayerBlockBreakCallback`, `ServerTickCallback` |

