## 📁 CONFIG & FILE STRUCTURE
```
config/admin-tools/
├── config.json          # Main config (thresholds, toggles, messages, CSV settings)
├── roles.json           # Role definitions & permissions
├── audit.json           # Action audit trail (JSON array)
├── chest_tracker.csv    # Owner-only CSV log
└── players/
    └── &lt;uuid&gt;.json      # Offline inventory/ender snapshots
```

**`config.json` Structure**:
```json
{
  "roles": { ... },
  "heuristic": {
    "overworld": { "max_break_rate": 6, "torch_ratio": 0.3, "ore_limit": 0.4, "alert_threshold": 75 },
    "the_nether": { ... },
    "the_end": { ... },
    "custom_biome_fallback": true
  },
  "alerts": {
    "warning_threshold": 65,
    "delay_seconds": 10,
    "cooldown_minutes": 5,
    "staff_permission": "admin.staff_alerts",
    "staff_message": "...",
    "public_message": "..."
  },
  "csv": { "path": "config/admin-tools/chest_tracker.csv", "max_mb": 50, "flush_interval_s": 30 },
  "overlay": { "enabled": true, "radius": 32, "performance_cap_fps": 20 },
  "spectator_stealth": { "enabled": true, "admin_reveal_permission": "admin.see_spectators" }
}
```

---
## 🛡️ SAFETY, THREADING & PERFORMANCE
- **Main Thread**: All server reads, GUI sync, command execution
- **Async Thread**: CSV writer, audit log flush, scheduler tasks
- **Packet Safety**: Validate all incoming client packets. Reject malformed data.
- **Memory**: GUIs dispose on close. Overlay releases GPU resources. No cached player data beyond session.
- **Anti-Cheat**: No chunk generation, no invisible entities, no packet manipulation for players. Spectator spoof only affects non-admin clients.
- **Config Validation**: Fail-safe defaults on load. Hot-reload validates JSON before swapping.

